# Normalise text in the repository, and pin LF for anything that is executed by
# a Linux box. deploy.sh runs on the deploy host and sw.js is served to browsers
# from the container; a CRLF working copy on Windows is fine for both, but they
# must never be committed with CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.sh      text eol=lf
Dockerfile text eol=lf
*.yml     text eol=lf
*.yaml    text eol=lf

*.png binary
*.ico binary
